  Also: e3c6eb4 made integer default — but registerStringOption_("trace:detector", default "openms") at :1485! Check: line 1485: `registerStringOption_("trace:detector", "<mode>", "openms", ...)`. Wait — in the current file, the default is still "openms"?! Let me re-check line 1485: yes, `"<mode>", "openms"`. And the doc text says "'openms' (default)...". Hmm — but e3c6eb4 says "Make trace:detector=integer the default". Let me grep to be sure. Maybe the default is set elsewhere (setDefault?). Need to check. If the registered default is still openms, then the commit's claim is wrong — the default never actually changed! Let me verify with git show e3c6eb4.

